{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cannon_dwarf","model_identifier":"cannon_dwarf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## cannon_dwarf\n\nDwarf cannon (E2), same rig, slots and clips as E1.\n\nPatch 5: `slot_muzzle` added at the muzzle mouth (inside the barrel bone) for the flash, sparks and smoke; nothing else changed.\n\n- Cubes: 51, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n- Bounds at rest: x -17.0..17.0, y 0.0..27.0, z -37.1..37.0 (size 34.0 x 27.0 x 74.1 u = 96 x 76 x 208 cm).\nDwarf cannon (sold by Dwarf cities): about 2 m long with the trail (74 u). A long steel-grey barrel (1.5 m = 53 u) with three brass bands, a brass muzzle and base ring, carved runic panels on both sides and the top, a brass sight, on a low, wide, dark-oak carriage (cheeks 3 u thick, wheels set 14 u out) with small 0.7 m (25 u) four-spoke wheels with heavy iron rims. Barrel axis 20 u up, matching the dwarf cannon crew (ram key ~20 u up, 40 u ahead; breech ~12 u ahead for aim/fire). Recoil is shorter (8 u, 22 cm) and the hop smaller because it is heavier.\nHauled field gun, faces -Z (muzzle forward), stands on y = 0 on its wheels and trail shoe.\n\n**Hit box:** one box 34 x 27 x 74 u (w x h x d), centred x = 0, z = -0, from y = 0.\n\n**Bones:** `root` > `carriage` (pivot at the trail shoe, so the fire hop rocks on the trail) > `barrel` (pivot at the trunnions, pitch = elevation; the game may set it directly to aim) > `fx_muzzle` (empty, at the muzzle mouth: spawn flash/smoke/ball here), `wheel_r`, `wheel_l` (pivots on the axle), `bucket` (sponge bucket).\n\n**Slots:** `slot_hitch` at the trail-end lunette (the limber or the animal's draw-bar hooks here; guns are towed trail-first), `slot_crew_1` = loader/rammer, standing 40 u in front of the muzzle, slightly right, facing +Z back toward the muzzle (the dwarf crew's `ram` key reaches ~40 u forward and ~20 u up), `slot_crew_2` = gunner 12 u behind the breech, just left of the trail, facing -Z. Crew slots sit on the ground (y = 0) and are children of `root` so they do not jump with the gun.\n\n**Move speed:** `move` is designed for 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s, ox/horse walk): the wheels make one turn per 2.21 s (circumference 78.5 u). `move` rolls the wheels for travel toward -Z (muzzle first, crew man-handling it); `move_towed` rolls them the other way for travel toward +Z (trail first behind the animal). Scale the clip speed for other speeds.\n\n**Key times:** `fire` key 0.08 s (the flash: spawn the ball at `fx_muzzle`); the gun jumps back 8.0 u (22 cm) by 0.4 s with a hop and wheel roll, settles, and the crew run it back into battery from 1.5 s to 2.4 s. `reload` key 2.4 s (loaded; the barrel is levelled for loading 0.5-2.4 s, then relaid). `aim` loops an elevation sweep. `damaged` 0.7 s shudder with a wobbling left wheel. `destroyed` holds: the right wheel breaks off and falls flat, the carriage drops onto its broken side, the barrel tips off its trunnions.\n\n**Props:** rammer and powder ladle for the crew are separate files in `cannon_rammer/`.\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop |\n|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |\n| `move` | 2.206 | loop |\n| `move_towed` | 2.206 | loop |\n| `fire` | 2.4 | once |\n| `reload` | 3 | once |\n| `aim` | 3 | loop |\n| `damaged` | 0.7 | once |\n| `destroyed` | 1.6 | hold |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_muzzle` at (0, 20, -37.5)\n- `slot_muzzle` at (0, 20, -37.5)\n- `slot_hitch` at (0, 3.5, 37)\n- `slot_crew_1` at (6, 0, -77)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-9, 0, 29)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"cheek_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[6.5,9,-17],"to":[9.5,21,1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,35],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,39,23,51],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[146,0,164,12],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[23,39,26,51],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[164,0,182,12],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[134,0,137,18],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[137,0,140,18],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"84f684d4-94a9-5493-8967-b7420bcb93dd"},{"name":"capsquare_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[6.25,20.5,-10.75],"to":[9.75,21.5,-7.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,35],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[113,78,116.5,79],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[117,78,120.5,79],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[121,78,124.5,79],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[125,78,128.5,79],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[58,66,61.5,69.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[62,66,65.5,69.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4b39c6ad-7a82-523d-b4ec-8f510c27c389"},{"name":"cheek_l","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.5,9,-17],"to":[-6.5,21,1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,35],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26,39,29,51],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[182,0,200,12],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[29,39,32,51],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[200,0,218,12],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[140,0,143,18],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[143,0,146,18],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"883adf07-c458-54d7-a885-568310d0a9d3"},{"name":"capsquare_l","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.75,20.5,-10.75],"to":[-6.25,21.5,-7.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,35],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[129,78,132.5,79],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[133,78,136.5,79],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[137,78,140.5,79],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[141,78,144.5,79],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[66,66,69.5,69.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[70,66,73.5,69.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f86838a5-d8b3-575c